From 2f634731d995f0bf99fe413bf0037f68c018c5ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gunnm92 <gunnm44@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 23:51:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(linux): DualSense USB/IP haptics destination, settings
 and status files

- GamepadMetadata::haptics_destination: host-chosen RTP destination; wins over
  LIBVIRTUALHID_DUALSENSE_HAPTICS_RTP when non-empty.
- LIBVIRTUALHID_DUALSENSE_SETTINGS: key=value file (gain, channels) that
  overrides the gain and channel environment variables; without a gain file
  variable it is also the hot-reloaded gain file.
- LIBVIRTUALHID_DUALSENSE_STATUS: JSON status rewritten about once per second
  while attached (atomic rename), with a closing record on close().
- Tests: destination precedence, settings overrides, invalid settings, status
  record layout and closing record.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
